  ('5e2897ad-a2de-4b60-bd68-e297e510ec3a', '5THK4', NULL, 'Пневмоцилиндр круглого сечения SPEEDAIRE: 3/4" отверстие, 12" ход', 'Цилиндр двустороннего действия из нержавеющей стали. Магнитный поршень. Вход воздуха 1/8" NPT.', NULL, '13c5a7a8-545c-43c4-b4fe-68e0902a484f', NULL, '56880.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', 'NCDMR075-1200', '{"Тип": "Двустороннего действия", "Длина хода": "12\"", "Вход воздуха": "1/8\" NPT", "Материал корпуса": "Нержавеющая сталь", "Диаметр отверстия": "3/4\""}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:23:34.665', '2026-06-19 11:23:34.665'),
  ('63b07f9b-9feb-48a4-aea5-6481738d7376', '893XW0', NULL, 'Стеллаж Cambro Elements Xtra: 4 полки, 64" высота, 24" глубина, 70" длина', 'Добавочный стеллаж для коммерческих кухонь. Совместим со стартовыми стеллажами. 4 полки (1 сплошная, 3 вентилируемые).', NULL, '2796b9df-669c-474a-88c7-64f51f12a8b2', NULL, '371085.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', 'EXA247264VS4480', '{"Цвет": "Серый", "Длина": "70\"", "Высота": "64\"", "Глубина": "24\"", "Нагрузка": "2,400 lb", "Количество полок": "4"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:23:34.78', '2026-06-19 11:23:34.78'),
  ('5705201b-99dd-4a39-8169-84ed0fc421c8', 'BOSCH-GBH-2-28', NULL, 'Перфоратор Bosch GBH 2-28: SDS-Plus, 880 Вт, 3.2 Дж', 'Профессиональный перфоратор для сверления и долбления в бетоне. Быстрозажимной патрон SDS-Plus. Антивибрационная система.', NULL, 'f2ce5ee3-b3b0-40ee-a515-2e309dbb0953', NULL, '185000.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '06112670F1', '{"Вес": "3.1 кг", "Мощность": "880 Вт", "Тип патрона": "SDS-Plus", "Энергия удара": "3.2 Дж", "Макс. диаметр в бетоне": "28 мм"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:23:34.859', '2026-06-19 11:23:34.859'),
  ('aea5d917-51f8-4f47-ad0a-cd032f760a5e', '852RN6', NULL, 'Smoke and Draft Seal: Batwing, Self-Adhesive Mounting, Std, Flex Elastomer/Rigid PVC, Brown', 'Fire and smoke perimeter door seals and gaskets expand when exposed to intense heat to seal gaps around doors and prevent fire and smoke from entering.', NULL, '55c5436a-0596-443e-b7a2-d678368d9268', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/4c14c931-5544-44cf-b5bf-236f2__N2B6_v2', '7332.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '852RN6', '{"Material": "Flexible Elastomer/Rigid PVC", "Seal Shape": "Batwing", "Product Type": "Smoke and Draft Seal", "Adhesive Bond": "Standard", "Overall Width": "1/2 in", "Mounting Style": "Self-Adhesive", "Overall Height": "1/2 in", "Overall Length": "7 ft"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:27:23.024', '2026-06-19 11:27:23.024'),
  ('563be0af-908f-4b0b-b142-b101acd30ea9', '439L76', NULL, 'Screw Machine Drill Bit: 41/64", 118° Point, HSS', 'These general purpose high-speed steel screw-machine length drill bits for metal and plastic have regular spiral flutes that are best suited for nonchipping hard materials such as nonferrous metals, cast iron, and structural steel. Screw-Machine Length drill bits are shorter than jobber-length and maintenance-length drill bits to provide high strength and rigidity for drilling straighter holes than longer drill bits, and provide access to tight spaces where longer drill bits cannot fit. High Speed Steel drill bits absorb more shock and vibration than cobalt and carbide, making them suitable for use in manual drilling machines and handheld power tools. Bright (Uncoated) drill bits can be resharpened and are a good choice when drilling soft materials such as aluminum and low-carbon steel. 118 ° drill bits are general purpose, used for soft materials like wood and aluminum. Conventional Point drill bits are used in most general purpose applications. Holes sometimes require pilot holes to prevent the bit from walking when it penetrates the workpiece. Straight Shank drill bits have the same diameter along the length of the bit for high concentricity and minimal tool runout for high-performance drilling. Spiral Flute drill bits are used in most general purpose holemaking applications to effectively evacuate chips as they drill into the workpiece.', NULL, 'd50fd3ed-9715-4516-8bb8-4aece8ec8113', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/F_CTD_2120__RH06_v1', '29591.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '439L76', '{"Point Type": "Conventional", "Flute Length": "2-7/8 in", "Finish/Coating": "Bright (Uncoated)", "Overall Length": "4-1/2 in", "Measurement System": "Fractional Inch", "Drill Bit Point Angle": "118  Degrees", "Size Decimal Equivalent": "0.6406", "Drill Bit Sizes Included": "41/64 in"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:27:23.081', '2026-06-19 11:27:23.081'),
  ('df818f0c-3f37-4545-a97e-c82c3439efa9', '64NV93', NULL, 'Reflective  Machine & Operation Danger Sign: Aluminum, Mounting Holes Sign Mounting, Engineer Grade', 'Aluminum, Reflective  Machine & Operation Danger Sign', NULL, '07fd8882-9305-404a-b34c-44c709e368a7', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/64RT45_AW01', '9170.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '64NV93', '{"Sign Shape": "Horizontal Rectangle", "Sign Format": "Traditional OSHA", "Sign Header": "Danger", "Sign Legend": "Don''t Clean Or Repair Machinery While In Motion", "Nominal Sign Size": "10 in x 14 in", "Sign Material Group": "Metal", "Sign Mounting Style": "Mounting Holes", "Indoor/Outdoor Usage": "Indoor/Outdoor"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:27:23.119', '2026-06-19 11:27:23.119'),
  ('51fd2e46-5f71-4498-8aae-cf4b43a0351a', '784TY2', NULL, 'Buna-N Round Cord: Buna-N, Round C.S. Shape, 0.21 in C.S., 10 ft Overall Lg', 'Buna-N cord stock resists petroleum-based fluids and chemicals, alcohols, and tears. Also known as nitrile rubber, it is durable and frequently used to create custom seals for parts and components of machines in indoor environments with moderate temperatures. Buna-N cord stock is the most common material used to manufacture O-rings.', NULL, 'f0e0a1f9-a714-4aea-84c9-b5f100d3a0c5', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/784TZ7-R3020-1_v1', '13466.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '784TY2', '{"Color": "Black", "Shape": "Round", "Material": "Buna-N", "Durometer Type": "Soft", "Overall Length": "10 ft", "Maximum Temperature": "250  Degrees F", "Minimum Temperature": "-40  Degrees F", "Cross Section Actual": "0.21 in"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:27:23.158', '2026-06-19 11:27:23.158'),
  ('b3f7fda4-4812-4fe5-8823-f3e01b0dc51a', '43NK61', NULL, 'Extruded Cylinder: 10 mm Bore, 20 mm Stroke, Non-Repairable, Aluminum, Basic Mounting, CJP2', 'These round-body air cylinders feature both a male threaded nose for panel mounting as well as a rear tab with a machined hole for clevis mounting.', NULL, 'eff0cf5a-203d-4be4-82e2-efe8fd25db95', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/43NK60_AW01', '21653.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '43NK61', '{"Body Material": "Aluminum", "Bore Diameter": "10 mm", "Cylinder Type": "Extruded", "Mounting Type": "Double End, Basic", "Stroke Length": "20 mm", "Cylinder Action": "Double Acting", "Magnetic Piston": "Magnetic Piston", "System of Measurement": "Metric"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:27:23.198', '2026-06-19 11:27:23.198'),
  ('c4fc446f-ae9d-4817-b18e-91b82f52b971', '810FV4', NULL, 'Clevis Pin: Inch, 7/8 in Pin Dia, 3 in Shank Lg, Precision Clevis Pin, Stainless Steel, 18-8, Plain', 'Precision clevis pins are manufactured with tighter tolerances than standard clevis pins. They are used in scientific equipment, measuring devices, and other applications where a precise fit is critical.', NULL, 'f0e0a1f9-a714-4aea-84c9-b5f100d3a0c5', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/PIN3017848__6VVS_v2', '22377.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '810FV4', '{"Material": "Stainless Steel", "Head Type": "Headed", "Pin Diameter": "7/8 in", "Product Type": "Precision Clevis Pin", "Shank Length": "3 in", "Head Diameter": "1-1/32 in", "Usable Length": "2-11/16 in", "System of Measurement": "Inch"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:27:23.23', '2026-06-19 11:27:23.23'),
  ('5812276c-3738-4139-8e2d-070752e9bdf2', '2WMP3', NULL, 'Sewage Ejector System: 41 gal, 1/2 hp, 115V AC, 120 gpm Flow Rate @ 10'' of Head, 4 in', 'Simplex sewage ejector pump systems include a single pump and the components necessary for installing a complete system.', NULL, '853e135c-a1c7-484c-80cc-137b0b5d0a0d', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/5YU17_AS01', '390876.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '2WMP3', '{"Phase": "Single", "Horsepower": "1/2 hp", "Power Source": "Corded Electric", "Rated Voltage": "115V AC", "Basin Capacity": "41 gal", "For Media Type": "Sewage Water", "Number of Pumps": "1", "Flow Rate @ 10 ft of Head": "120 gpm"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:27:25.321', '2026-06-19 11:27:25.321'),
  ('0d995237-7e6c-4d46-8e1a-08b988a42354', '61LE87', NULL, 'Corner Radius End Mill: Carbide, TiAlN Coated, 5 Flute, 3/8" Mill Dia, 9/16" LOC, 0.03" Rad', 'Fast-cutting carbide corner-radius end mills for cutting stainless steel and super alloys (such as titanium, nickel, and cobalt) have a variable helix angle (sometimes called variable pitch) that minimizes harmonics and chatter to allow for higher cutting speeds than standard helix mills. Carbide end mills provide excellent wear and heat resistance and are harder than high-speed steel or cobalt. TiAlN coating (titanium aluminum nitride) withstands high temperatures for use at high speeds and resists cracks and oxidation better than TiN or TiCN coatings. It is suitable for milling heat-resistant alloys, cast iron, steel, and stainless steel, and has a coating oxidation temperature of 800° C and a coating hardness of 2800 HV. Corner-radius end mills create a flat-bottomed groove with slightly rounded inside corners in milling applications that require a specific radius. Center-cutting end mills cut on the end and sides of the mill and are used for plunging, ramping, and machining bottom surfaces. Finishing end mills create a finer finish on the workpiece than roughing and roughing/finishing end mills.', NULL, '42b713be-4a1f-4c49-b545-0cd871a89651', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/61LD88_AS01', '29634.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '61LE87', '{"Corner Radius": "0.03 in", "Length of Cut": "9/16 in, 0.5625 in", "Milling Diameter": "3/8 in, 0.375 in", "Number of Flutes": "5", "Finish - Machining": "TiAlN", "ISO Material Group": "S, M", "Measurement System": "Inch", "Material Application": "Nickel, Titanium, Stainless Steel"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:27:23.273', '2026-06-19 11:27:23.273'),
  ('0b22c68c-1043-4af0-9db7-342893ef16b2', '61DU90', NULL, 'Check Valves: Swing, 2-Way, Inline Valve Body, 1/2 in Pipe Size, FNPT x FNPT, Std', 'Stainless steel inline swing check valves are abrasion-resistant, corrosion-resistant, and suitable for high-pressure and high-temperature applications.', NULL, '6cc0c9f9-f12b-4a7a-a4f2-21f89331142b', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/61DU88_AS01', '54285.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '61DU90', '{"For Media": "Water, Steam", "Body Material": "304 Stainless Steel", "Connection Type": "FNPT x FNPT", "Valve Body Style": "Inline", "Nominal Valve Size": "1/2 in", "3-A Standard Compliance": "Not Rated", "Maximum Pressure - Steam": "80 psi", "Maximum Pressure - Operating": "200 psi"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:27:23.315', '2026-06-19 11:27:23.315'),
  ('995189b0-3ee3-4262-8035-cf5c5734d539', '35UU79', NULL, 'Boltless Shelving: Add-On, Medium-Duty, 72 in x 48 in, 84 in Overall Ht, 3 Shelves', 'Medium-duty boltless metal shelving units generally are sturdier and can hold heavier items than light-duty boltless shelving units. These shelving units have particleboard decking, which provides a smooth, solid surface that prevents items from falling through the shelving and will not mar or snag items placed on it. The decking installs over the shelving units'' beams to distribute the weight of items placed on the decking across the beams.', NULL, '4a6d3609-0d46-4cef-ae5f-444ff4798dd1', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/35UU79-R3020-UC-1_v1', '235616.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '35UU79', '{"Duty Rating": "Medium-Duty", "Overall Depth": "48 in", "Overall Width": "72 in", "Overall Height": "84 in", "Decking Material": "Particleboard", "Side Panel Style": "Open", "Number of Shelves": "3", "Shelving Configuration": "Add-On"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:27:23.355', '2026-06-19 11:27:23.355'),
  ('cd17cea8-9557-48bc-9b99-f3a67256e44f', '35NK05', NULL, 'Color Coded Handle: Threaded, European, Polypropylene, 67 in Lg, 1 1/4 in Dia, Blue', 'Handles with European thread connections will only attach to broom or brush heads with compatible European threads for a secure attachment. European threads are finer and tighter than standard (or ACME) threads and help seal the handle to the broom or brush eliminating space for contaminants which is important in food processing applications. These handles replace worn or broken handles or extend the reach of existing broom or brush heads.', NULL, '560d9434-7180-4f89-9ff6-38a4c650eb0d', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/35NK05_AW01', '26950.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '35NK05', '{"Handle Color": "Blue", "Grip Material": "Polypropylene", "Handle Length": "67 in", "Handle Diameter": "1-1/4 in", "Handle Material": "Polypropylene", "Connection Thread Type": "European", "Handle Connection Type": "Threaded"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:27:23.394', '2026-06-19 11:27:23.394'),
  ('6f8b2c3c-bca1-44a7-9e0a-f03d92fdacc7', '415R80', NULL, 'Athletic Shoe: Men''s, Size 10 1/2, W, Gray, Steel Toe Cap, Removable Insole', 'Athletic-style safety-toe shoes are designed with lightweight, breathable materials that provide enhanced cushioning and flexibility. They have a casual aesthetic and are suitable for indoor environments. Steel toe cap material protects the toes from light impact and compression caused by walking into obstacles or small falling objects. It deforms when damaged, providing a visual indication that the footwear has been compromised. Flat Heel has a continuous, uninterrupted sole design with minimal variation in height from the toe to the heel. It provides comfort and grip on even flooring and pavement. Wide is a range that includes W, E, and EE shoe widths.', NULL, '6b75efa8-176f-4ec4-b441-81019690d44b', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/415R46_AS03', '62360.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '415R80', '{"Size": "10-1/2", "Gender": "Men''s", "Color Family": "Gray", "Footwear Style": "Athletic Shoe", "Footwear Width": "W, Wide", "Overall Height": "3 in", "Toe Cap Material": "Steel", "ASTM Standards Met": "Static Dissipative (SD 100), Compression (C), Impact (I)"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:27:23.435', '2026-06-19 11:27:23.435'),
  ('e15177e5-b0e9-419c-a34a-eaf34b490b37', '20D422', NULL, 'Expansion Reamer: 15/16 in', 'Straight-shank expansion reamers have straight shanks that fit in the chucks of drill presses or other machining tools. High Speed Steel reamers offer good wear resistance, have some flexibility, and can absorb some shock and vibration. Bright (Uncoated) tools can be resharpened and are a good choice for use on soft materials, such as aluminum and low-carbon steel. Straight reamers move chips into the flutes but do not evacuate them, so are best for through holes and materials that produce short chips. They are stronger than spiral-flute tools and resist breaking when used on hard and abrasive materials, such as hardened steels with a Rockwell hardness of 35 to 60 HRC. They provide free-cutting action, generate minimal heat during use, and leave a smooth finish on the hole.', NULL, '52ebbfc2-f500-4eea-8030-e4c54a941a7e', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/20D404_AW01', '229130.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '20D422', '{"Flute Type": "Straight", "Shank Type": "Straight", "Flute Length": "1-1/2 in", "Overall Length": "10 in", "Shank Diameter": "3/4 in", "Number of Flutes": "8", "Measurement System": "Fractional Inch", "Reamer Sizes Included": "15/16 in"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:27:23.476', '2026-06-19 11:27:23.476'),
  ('0da69da6-390e-4573-8ab4-3abda04b6ed6', '793ZD4', NULL, 'Foam Tape: Conformable, 3/4 in Wd, 5 yd Lg, 62 mil Thick, Gray, Acrylic, Closed, Acrylic Foam', 'These continuous rolls of double-sided, high-strength foam tape are used in general industrial applications to display signs, mount trim, or attach stiffeners to panels without the use of tools and hardware.', NULL, '622ff446-8e0c-4c6b-9654-17250cf2b0de', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/793Z65_AS01', '19420.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '793ZD4', '{"Series": "GPH-160GF", "Product Form": "Continuous Roll", "Tape Thickness": "62 mil", "Imperial Tape Width": "3/4 in", "Tape Conformability": "Conformable", "Imperial Tape Length": "5 yd", "Tape Backing Material": "Acrylic Foam", "Tape Adhesive Material": "Acrylic"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:27:23.516', '2026-06-19 11:27:23.516'),
  ('3577a4a9-1194-4ad1-b2ea-09d976fa5940', '46P328', NULL, 'Strap System: Nylon, Black', 'Y-strap systems lay a yoke across the shoulders and multiple bands across the body for a greater degree of security than other types of straps. They are typically used on backboards for full-body immobilization.', NULL, '0dd1e22d-6a96-4bbb-86b1-a286e616f04b', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/46P328_AS01', '147533.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '46P328', '{"Color": "Black", "End Type": "Loop", "Material": "Nylon", "Buckle Material": "Plastic"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:44.12', '2026-06-19 11:28:44.12'),
  ('af42277f-c021-4eb9-a418-5ca20f3da392', '34A037', NULL, 'Electric Chain Hoist: H4 - Heavy Duty, 480V AC, Hook Mounted - No Trolley, Variable Speeds', 'These extended-use electric hoists are rated to exceed 300 starts/stops per hour. They are suitable for high-volume construction and manufacturing applications where loads are frequently lifted and positioned.', NULL, '6c4d6e3e-e52d-46ab-8a65-9f3b7ec57dda', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/34A033_AS01', '2914414.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '34A037', '{"Headroom": "16-7/16 in", "Lift Speed": "0.18 m/min - 15 m/min", "Mount Type": "Hook Mounted - No Trolley", "Lift Length": "16 ft, 15 ft", "Programmable": "Non-Programmable", "Lifting Capacity": "1,100 lb", "Number of Speeds": "Variable", "ASME Duty Classification": "H4 - Heavy Duty"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:27:23.557', '2026-06-19 11:27:23.557'),
  ('8197c08b-5cb8-4b93-b567-201549ce4b93', '26KU31', NULL, 'Socket Head Cap Screw: 1 1/8"-7 Thread Size, 11 in Lg, Std, Black Oxide, Alloy Steel, 7/8 in Drive', 'Inch standard socket head cap screws are measured and manufactured in imperial or inch units. They have cylindrical heads that are approximately the same height as the screw shank diameter.', NULL, 'f0e0a1f9-a714-4aea-84c9-b5f100d3a0c5', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/26KU31-R0020-1_v1', '18899.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '26KU31', '{"Material": "Steel, Alloy Steel", "Head Type": "Standard", "Drive Type": "Socket", "Finish Type": "Black Oxide", "Thread Size": "1-1/8\"-7", "Material Type": "Alloy Steel, Steel", "Overall Length": "11 in", "System of Measurement": "Inch"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:27:23.587', '2026-06-19 11:27:23.587'),
  ('fc88fc1a-33d0-4265-9e47-e55b26921dcb', '426D79', NULL, 'Combination Wrench: Alloy Steel, Chrome, 5/8 in Head Size, 5 in Overall Lg, Offset', 'These combination wrenches have a 12-pt. box end with additional grooves that make it easier to connect with the head of the fastener and connect at more angles for better accessibility compared to a 6-pt. wrench. The opposite side has an open end design that allows top and side access to the fastener compared to the box end that can only access a fastener from the top. The wrenches have the same SAE (inch) size on each end for use on one specific size fastener.', NULL, 'd0e26579-152e-4048-ba2c-014cd6614b04', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/22DH01_AS01', '13842.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '426D79', '{"Head Size": "5/8 in", "Head Type": "Offset", "Box End Type": "12-Point Box End", "Opening Type": "Hex", "Measurement Type": "SAE", "Head Offset Angle": "15  Degrees", "Wrench Length Style": "Stubby", "Opening Angle (Deg.)": "15  Degrees"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:27:23.622', '2026-06-19 11:27:23.622'),
  ('60004719-5550-4ddf-a45d-7f24e6a21545', '838WT4', NULL, 'Military/Tactical Boot: Military/Tactical Boot Footwear, Men''s, 10 Size, E, 8 in Boot Ht, 1 PR', 'Tactical boots and shoes include a range of colors and features to match the uniform requirements and the needs of the work environment for military and law enforcement personnel.', NULL, 'b548775e-3055-42e0-97f6-e59d6632e2d3', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/12393ABR_main__J891_v2', '64070.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '838WT4', '{"Size": "10", "Width": "E", "Gender": "Men''s", "Insulated": "No", "Boot Height": "8 in", "Style Number": "12393ABR", "Footwear Style": "Military/Tactical Boot", "Predominant Footwear Color": "Coyote"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:27:23.661', '2026-06-19 11:27:23.661'),
  ('e64e1a07-6dd3-482f-aa14-dd1295839560', '19H247', NULL, 'Welded-Wire Machine Guard Door: 82 in x 34 in, Pull, Snap Lock, Header Bar', 'High-strength welded-wire machine guard components assemble with bolts and nuts to form barriers that keep people away from moving machinery and hazardous processes in industrial facilities. Their panels have crossed wires welded everywhere they intersect to create a mesh. Welded-wire panels are more durable and stable than woven-wire panels. They will not unravel if cut, accommodating pipes and other obstacles.', NULL, '708aafa5-9070-4eae-a148-4fa3eaf2b37a', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/19H247_AS01', '227043.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '19H247', '{"Color": "Black", "Finish": "Powder-Coated", "Lock Type": "Snap Lock", "Door Width": "34 in", "Component Type": "Hinged Door", "Overall Height": "82 in", "Wire Mesh Opening HxW": "2-1/2 in x 1-1/4 in", "Includes Mounting Hardware": "Yes"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:27:23.703', '2026-06-19 11:27:23.703'),
  ('6926469f-d880-4517-9ee5-ea380765652d', '1GYU7', NULL, 'Shipping Tag: #4, 4 1/4 in Tag Ht, 2 1/8 in Tag Wd, 13 Points, Green, 1,000 PK', 'These paper shipping tags come in a variety of colors and can be used for color-coding products or shipments. These blank tags provide room to write or print information such as shipping addresses, product IDs, inventory tallies, and handling instructions. They tie onto products when a standard adhesive label will not fit, or is not practical.', NULL, 'f0e0a1f9-a714-4aea-84c9-b5f100d3a0c5', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/1GYU5_AS02', '31170.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '1GYU7', '{"Tag Color": "Green", "Tag Style": "Pre-Wired", "Tag Width": "2-1/8 in", "Tag Height": "4-1/4 in", "Tag Number": "#4", "Tag Material": "Paper", "Card Stock Gauge": "13 Points", "Shipping Tag Type": "Colored"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:27:23.737', '2026-06-19 11:27:23.737'),
  ('dbd0cf9b-fec3-4686-a6b9-b3b2340adbda', '821U45', NULL, 'Motorized Wand Cellular Shade: Light Filtering, 60 in Ht, 27 1/2 in Wd, Ivory, PVC', 'These light-filtering cellular shades use an attached, motorized wand to open and close the shades, and they diffuse but do not entirely block incoming light.', NULL, '839aab3b-2502-428a-b15d-2e595ac1712d', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/CellularWandLightFIlteringIvo__B0EZ_v2', '137752.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '821U45', '{"Shade Width": "27-1/2 in", "Shade Height": "60 in", "Fabric Weight": "35 g", "Shade Material": "Polyester", "Shade Thickness": "3/8 mm", "Shade Color Family": "White", "Operation Mechanism": "Motorized Wand", "Light Reduction - Qualitiative": "Light Filtering"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:27:23.777', '2026-06-19 11:27:23.777'),
  ('b67f6e6f-4f83-41e9-b7cc-3b9f17645f31', '6ZY73', NULL, 'Socket Set Screw: #10-24 Thread Size, 3/4 in Overall Lg, Cup pt, Alloy Steel, Black Oxide, 100 PK', 'Cup point set screws use a concaved tip with a dome or cone-shaped depression to bite into the mounting surface. This creates a matching indent on the mounting surface that the tip engages with and helps resist rotation.', NULL, 'f0e0a1f9-a714-4aea-84c9-b5f100d3a0c5', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/6ZY73_GC01', '10556.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '6ZY73', '{"Finish": "Black Oxide", "Material": "Steel, Alloy Steel", "Drive Type": "Socket", "Point Type": "Cup", "Finish Type": "Black Oxide", "Thread Size": "#10-24", "Overall Length": "3/4 in", "System of Measurement": "Inch"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:27:23.809', '2026-06-19 11:27:23.809'),
  ('d0d26a6f-5738-4fe0-9ed9-d46751fa5778', '49UR55', NULL, 'Striking Wrench: Aluminum/Bronze, Natural, 130 mm Head Size, 20 in Overall Lg, Aluminum Bronze', 'Nonsparking striking box-end wrenches won’t spark during use, making them suitable for use in flammable environments. A block shape on one end of the handle is struck with a hammer to loosen or tighten a fastener. The opposite end has an enclosed head end (box end) that fits around the entire head of the fastener for a more secure grip while turning compared to an open end. These metric wrenches have a straight handle and a 12-pt. design with additional grooves that make it easier to connect with the head of the fastener and connect at more angles for better accessibility compared to a 6-pt. wrench.', NULL, '7d185a78-e753-46a0-b29f-146bb5e6b69e', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/49UR70_AS01', '1822246.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '49UR55', '{"Finish": "Natural", "Material": "Bronze, Aluminum, Aluminum Bronze", "Head Size": "130 mm", "Box End Type": "12-Point Box End", "Head Thickness": "2-5/16 in", "Overall Length": "20 in", "Measurement Type": "Metric", "Head Offset Angle": "0  Degrees"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:27:23.848', '2026-06-19 11:27:23.848'),
  ('b0472f97-d48f-4679-b81d-5528d04d97f0', '796WY1', NULL, 'Stainless Steel Rod: 316, 7/16 in Outside Dia, 4 ft Overall Lg, Cold Rolled, Annealed, Mill', 'Highly corrosion-resistant 316 stainless steel rods have excellent corrosion resistance, especially in marine environments. They are stronger (though less machinable) than 304 rods and maintain strength in extreme temperatures. Typical uses include oil and petroleum equipment, paper and textile machinery, food processing equipment, architectural applications, and general industrial and marine applications.', NULL, 'f0e0a1f9-a714-4aea-84c9-b5f100d3a0c5', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/3ANN1-R2030-1_v1', '12573.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '796WY1', '{"Shape": "Rod", "Fabrication": "Cold Rolled", "Material Grade": "316", "Overall Length": "4 ft", "Yield Strength": "37 ksi", "Outside Diameter": "7/16 in", "Mechanical Finish": "Mill", "Includes Material Certificate": "Material Certificate with Lot Number"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:27:23.881', '2026-06-19 11:27:23.881'),
  ('4df3c8af-5451-4226-8e2c-03eb39870080', '786GJ9', NULL, 'Stainless Steel Square Tube: 304, 36 in Overall Lg, 0.25 in Wall Thick, 4 in x 4 in, Welded, Mill', 'General purpose 304 stainless steel square tubes have four equal sides. They combine strength, machinability, and excellent corrosion resistance in non-marine environments. They are often used for architectural trim, food and beverage machinery, chemical processing equipment, and aerospace and cryogenic applications.', NULL, 'f0e0a1f9-a714-4aea-84c9-b5f100d3a0c5', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/786GE0-R2030-1_v1', '297383.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '786GJ9', '{"Shape": "Square", "Inside Width": "3-1/2 in", "Inside Height": "3-1/2 in", "Outside Width": "4 in", "Material Grade": "304", "Outside Height": "4 in", "Overall Length": "36 in", "Wall Thickness": "0.25 in"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:27:23.911', '2026-06-19 11:27:23.911'),
  ('c9cb1e21-269f-41c2-9ca6-7b51c7547950', '405Y98', NULL, 'Steam Trap: Stainless Steel, 1/2 in FNPT, 1,200 lb/hr, Strainer Included, 600 psi Max., 800°F Max.', 'Corrosion-resistant thermodynamic steam traps are constructed with materials that are highly resistant to corrosive elements in the heating system or the surrounding environment.', NULL, 'e57d4e58-bce4-43a1-b567-6e5e603522e7', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/405Y98-A3020-1_v2', '171461.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '405Y98', '{"Port Connection": "1/2 in FNPT", "Steam Trap Type": "Thermodynamic", "Strainer Included": "Yes", "Condensate Capacity": "1,200 lb/hr", "Installation Orientation": "Horizontal", "Operating Temperature - Maximum": "800  Degrees F"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:27:23.947', '2026-06-19 11:27:23.947'),
  ('d4f255a9-9608-467e-add4-5bb712173440', '823RH3', NULL, 'Vinyl Floor Tiles: Silk, Std Excelon Imperial Texture, 12 in Tile Wd, Smooth', 'Imperial Texture VCT (vinyl composition tile) has a wide range of color options, consists mostly of limestone and some vinyl, requires daily maintenance, is suitable for heavy foot traffic areas in commercial buildings, and has a nondirectional pattern that hides wear and tear.', NULL, '5661f497-ba20-4fb9-b463-30aeff8025ce', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/59234_2B__LAEG_v1', '49345.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '823RH3', '{"Finish": "Smooth", "Standards": "CAN/ULC S102.2, ASTM E 662, ASTM E 648", "Tile Width": "12 in", "Tile Length": "12 in", "Color Family": "White", "Coverage Area": "45 sq ft", "Tile Thickness": "1/8 in"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:27:23.985', '2026-06-19 11:27:23.985'),
