  ('b670db73-c8c6-4100-9005-f1261ade2c63', '393CH8', NULL, 'Wedge V-Belt: C270, 272 in Outside Lg, 7/8 in Top Wd, 17/32 in Thick, Polyester', 'C section classical V-belts are used in medium-horsepower drive systems in applications such as conveyors, industrial blowers, and machinery. C is a classical V-belt where single belts have a nominal thickness of 17/32" and a nominal top width of 7/8". The top width for banded belts varies depending on the number of belts fused together. SBR (styrene-butadiene rubber) is a general purpose belt material for light to moderate industrial drives. Polyester is a strong reinforcing cord material with heat- and stretch-resistance in general purpose applications where conditions are not extreme.', NULL, 'ae3c8bbe-301a-4e7a-8868-271f0153884b', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/HI_POWER_II-1_TOP__WD6C_v2', '102432.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '393CH8', '{"Top Width": "7/8 in", "Belt Series": "Hi-Power(R) II", "V-Belt Type": "Wedge", "Number of Ribs": "1", "Outside Length": "272 in", "Belt Trade Size": "C", "Industry Number": "C270", "Reinforcing Cord Material": "Polyester"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:33.105', '2026-06-19 11:28:33.105'),
