  ('7a1047a2-070a-48fc-8423-1fcfb75466ef', '4NA85', NULL, 'Spring Return Hose Reel: 100 ft (3/8 in I.D.), 3/8 in MNPT, 300 psi Max Op Pressure, Red', 'Dual-arm air or water spring-return hose reels are built with all-steel, reinforced dual-pedestal bases and arms for increased stability. These low-pressure reels are powder-coated for corrosion resistance, mount on a wall, ceiling, or in a truck, and include a field adjustable guide arm. Dual-arm hose reels hold air or water hoses and are commonly used in manufacturing facilities, auto or fleet service centers, and with food and chemical processing.', NULL, '5abf8115-3052-4a80-892b-1efb5f95eb51', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/4NA85_AS01', '496452.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '4NA85', '{"Enclosed": "No", "Drive Type": "Spring Return", "Hose Capacity": "100 ft (3/8 in I.D.)", "Includes Hose": "Yes", "Pedestal Type": "Dual Pedestal", "Mounting Location": "Floor, Truck, Ceiling, Wall", "Number of Guide Arms": "Double Arm", "Speed Limited Retraction": "No"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:34.13', '2026-06-19 11:28:34.13'),
  ('d78eec46-5ae1-4988-aca0-673709639f34', '788N78', NULL, 'Concealed blade metal detectable knife: 5 13/16 in Overall Lg, Straight Handle, Blue, 10 PK', 'Dual hooks on these disposable safety cutters provide two cutting edges. The hook tip pierces materials, and the recessed blade within the hook slices through as the cutters are pulled back. The cutters are disposed of when the blades wear out. Dual-hook cutters cut shrink wrap, plastic pallet strapping, corrugated cardboard, and other thin materials.', NULL, '36dfa252-17b8-4b31-80c8-8b6dd244cb83', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/788N78_AS01', '49519.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '788N78', '{"Grip Type": "Textured", "Disposable": "Yes", "Antimicrobial": "No", "NSF Certified": "No", "Blade Material": "Stainless Steel", "Overall Length": "5-13/16 in", "Metal Detectable": "Yes", "Includes Tape Splitter": "Yes"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:34.735', '2026-06-19 11:28:34.735'),
  ('7e5534b7-3c28-496c-957d-9912c11ea720', '24TT78', NULL, 'General Purpose Motor: Open Drip Proof, Rigid Base Mount, 1 HP, 1760 rpm Nameplate RPM', 'NEMA 140 frame three-phase general purpose AC motors have a standard 7/8" diameter, 2-1/4" length shaft whose center is 3-1/2" above the base mounting surface. Variations to the frame''s standard dimensions and design are indicated by a letter designation following the frame number, such as 143T or 145TC. The letter “T” specifies integral HP motor dimension standards set by NEMA in 1953 and 1964, and “C” indicates that the motor can be face mounted. These frame standards and letter designations are defined by the National Electrical Manufacturers Association (NEMA).', NULL, '6fd63ef9-cf1f-4ecc-b5bc-48b29bbe21ce', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/24TT78_AS01', '557246.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '24TT78', '{"HP": "1", "Frame": "143T", "Voltage": "208-230/460V AC", "RPM Range": "1,701-1,800, 1701-1800", "Motor Design": "Three-Phase", "Motor Mounting Type": "Rigid Base", "Motor Enclosure Design": "Open Drip Proof", "Motor Thermal Protection": "None"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:34.158', '2026-06-19 11:28:34.158'),
