  ('4062fb8d-6920-419f-888e-fb30674aaf33', '62NG31', NULL, 'Cable Tie Mounting Base: 0.17 in Slot Wd, 0.07 in Slot Ht, White, 0.75 in Wd, 100 PK', 'Adhesive mount cable tie bases stick to clean, dry surfaces and don''t require any mounting tools. They have slots to thread in cable ties to bundle and hang wire and cable.', NULL, 'cc8b523d-c0be-4d6d-a2e6-333e6e75666f', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/62NG30_AA01', '49153.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '62NG31', '{"Color": "White", "Slot Width": "0.17 in", "Slot Height": "0.07 in", "Temp. Range": "-20 Degrees  to 179 Degrees F", "For Use With": "Miniature and Intermediate Cable Ties", "Mounting Method": "Adhesive Mount", "Number of Entries": "4"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:34.632', '2026-06-19 11:28:34.632'),
  ('4e3188e0-7409-450c-8c45-928d7284e60c', '825XC8', NULL, 'Nonmetallic Sheathed Cable: 14 AWG, 3 Conductors, 1,000 ft, Blue, 600 V Volt', 'These building cables are lighter than metal-clad building cables, and their pliable sheathing makes them easier to unspool, straighten out, and handle. Type NM-B cable is for enclosed, interior wiring in dry locations only (typically within a wall, ceiling, or under a floor) and should not be used outdoors or anywhere it might get wet. It is used to power outlets, lighting, and appliances in residential and commercial applications. NM-B (non-metallic sheathed building) cable is a type of electrical wiring used in commercial and residential applications. It features a durable PVC jacket that protects it from heat, moisture, oils, and other similar chemicals. Nylon sheathing is a synthetic polymer jacket that protects the conductors and inner insulation against abrasion and chemicals and remains flexible across a broad range of temperatures. Solid indicates the wire or conductor encased in the cable is solid.', NULL, '7044f7e0-af0d-4f9a-9d47-224f7bc4625a', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/63946872__APHV_v1', '442251.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '825XC8', '{"Voltage": "600 V", "Jacket Color": "Blue", "Conductor Size": "14 AWG", "Overall Length": "1,000 ft", "Jacket Material": "Nylon", "Conductor Design": "Solid", "Trade Designation": "NM-B", "Number of Conductors": "3"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:34.674', '2026-06-19 11:28:34.674'),
  ('c1ef1cb4-c82d-49f9-b61c-d2fce1c9f5a7', '838WT7', NULL, 'Military/Tactical Boot: Military/Tactical Boot Footwear, Men''s, 11 1/2 Size, E, 12393ABR, 1 PR', 'Tactical boots and shoes include a range of colors and features to match the uniform requirements and the needs of the work environment for military and law enforcement personnel.', NULL, 'b548775e-3055-42e0-97f6-e59d6632e2d3', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/12393ABR_main__J891_v2', '64070.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '838WT7', '{"Size": "11-1/2", "Width": "E", "Gender": "Men''s", "Insulated": "No", "Boot Height": "8 in", "Style Number": "12393ABR", "Footwear Style": "Military/Tactical Boot", "Predominant Footwear Color": "Coyote"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:34.704', '2026-06-19 11:28:34.704'),
  ('3ac3e9aa-437f-4979-b780-a0e5bf025874', '55JX54', NULL, 'Lockout Padlock: Keyed Different, Nylon, Std Body Body Size, Steel, Extended, Black, Plastic', 'Nonconductive plastic-body LOTO padlocks inhibit the transfer of electricity, making them ideal for locking out electrical components. They are lightweight alternatives to heavy-duty steel and aluminum-body LOTO padlocks. Plastic lock bodies are nonconductive. When selecting a plastic body padlock with a plastic shackle, the lock is also non-sparking. Steel shackles are heavy-duty and made for use in harsh weather environments or where impact is a concern. Keyed Different padlocks that do not share a common key. They are used when multiple workers in the same location each need to secure an energy source. Keyed-different padlocks reduce the risk of one worker inadvertently removing another worker''s lock.', NULL, '93082288-4fe3-4dea-b190-e19d64706a49', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/55JX54_AS01', '14274.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '55JX54', '{"Key Type": "Keyed Different", "Body Size": "Standard Body", "Body Color": "Black", "Body Material": "Plastic", "Shackle Height": "3 in", "Shackle Diameter": "1/4 in", "Shackle Material": "Steel", "Non-Removable Key": "Yes"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:34.768', '2026-06-19 11:28:34.768'),
  ('834c0bca-ed1c-4a7f-826d-0e2e43e026c9', '59LJ39', NULL, 'Scraper Blade: Steel', 'Snow blower blades, cables, and accessories change out components for a different style or add components to enhance the machine''s operation.', NULL, '301eb613-cd8d-467f-a0ed-b73fb9c1bb1b', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/0388445959LJ39-ScraperBlade__ONXZ_v2', '20666.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '59LJ39', '{"Material": "Steel", "Product Type": "Scraper Blade", "Overall Width": "1-3/4 in", "Overall Height": "1/8 in", "Overall Length": "23-3/4 in", "Compatible Product Type": "Snow Blower", "Manufacturer Part Number": "03884451", "Compatible with Manufacturer Model Number": "920313, 920309, 920402, 920400, 920305, 920404, 920405"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:34.817', '2026-06-19 11:28:34.817'),
  ('5955fe14-8e33-4f74-81d0-e65471f3ac8f', '54JR99', NULL, 'Gas Spring: M8 Thread Size, 4 11/16 in Ext Lg, 2,700 lbf Force, End Fittings Not Included', 'Gas springs are mechanical devices that use the pressure from compressed gas and liquids to assist in opening or closing objects such as windows, seats, covers, and car hatchbacks or trunks. They consist of a rod and piston housed in a cylinder, and when the pressure inside the cylinder is released, the rod moves outward, moving the object it is attached to. Also called gas shocks or gas struts, gas springs should be installed with the rod facing down to prevent the liquid inside the cylinder from drying out.', NULL, '623e30ad-47da-40ad-8da4-cbc6677a8006', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/54JR30_AS01', '229454.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '54JR99', '{"Force": "2,700 lbf", "Thread Size": "M8", "Rod Diameter": "25 mm", "Extended Length": "4-11/16 in", "Compressed Length": "4-13/64 in", "Cylinder Diameter": "50.2 mm", "Cylinder Material": "Steel", "End Fittings Type": "End Fittings Not Included, None"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:34.856', '2026-06-19 11:28:34.856'),
  ('10c0ca44-d976-4b1a-994c-e1b55ca20719', '817TM0', NULL, 'Hot Melt Adhesive: 501, Smooth Sticks, 1/2 in Dia, 10 in Lg, White, 85 PK', 'General purpose hot melt adhesives bond a wide range of materials and work on many applications where a specialized adhesive isn''t required.', NULL, 'f7abb41f-e050-4e6d-95bc-ba36de5e56cf', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/501-110-5-02__TNTD_v1', '32280.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '817TM0', '{"Length": "10 in", "Diameter": "1/2 in", "Color Family": "White", "Product Format": "Smooth Sticks", "Working Time Range": "20 seconds to 45 seconds", "Primary Application": "For General Purpose", "Melting Temperature Range": "151 Degrees F to 249 Degrees F", "Secondary Compatible Materials": "Plastics"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:34.9', '2026-06-19 11:28:34.9'),
  ('f49da194-0b66-4b5e-af4b-fbf503698371', '3ELX2', NULL, 'Inline Strainer: Polypropylene, 3/4 in, NPT, Mesh, 0.007 in Screen Size, 4 1/4 in Ht, 3 in Lg', 'Polypropylene inline strainers are made from a lightweight thermoplastic polymer that offers impact strength, surface hardness, and resistance to abrasions and corrosion. They protect pumps, regulators, control valves, and other process equipment from floating debris in water management, food processing, and industrial applications.', NULL, '90f594d2-7881-40d5-a605-c4e4a94b8542', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/3ELX2-A3020-1_v1', '15670.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '3ELX2', '{"Material": "Polypropylene", "Pipe Size": "3/4 in", "Bowl Color": "Clear", "Screen Size": "0.007 in", "Seal Material": "EPDM", "Strainer Type": "Mesh", "Screen Material": "316 Stainless Steel", "Strainer Connection Type": "NPT"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:34.944', '2026-06-19 11:28:34.944'),
  ('247700bf-a171-4c2b-8eea-3f78336c9f3f', '35DE70', NULL, 'Roughing End Mill: Cobalt, 3 Flute, 3/4" Mill Dia, 3" LOC, 5-1/4" OAL', 'This cobalt roughing end mill is optimized for use on nonferrous metals. Cobalt end mills can be used at higher speeds and are harder and more wear resistant than high-speed steel. Uncoated end mills are used for milling a wide range materials in general purpose milling applications. Square end mills cut flat-bottomed grooves with 90° inside corners. They''re also used for counterboring, side and face milling, and milling square shoulders. Center-cutting end mills cut on the end and sides of the mill and are used for plunging, ramping, and machining bottom surfaces. Roughing end mills remove large amounts of material from a workpiece more quickly than roughing/finishing end mills. Roughing is generally followed by a finishing pass.', NULL, '42b713be-4a1f-4c49-b545-0cd871a89651', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/35DE64_AW01', '110055.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '35DE70', '{"Length of Cut": "3 in", "End Mill Style": "Square", "Milling Diameter": "0.75 in, 3/4 in", "Number of Flutes": "3", "Finish - Machining": "Uncoated", "ISO Material Group": "N", "Measurement System": "Inch", "Material Application": "Aluminum"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:34.984', '2026-06-19 11:28:34.984'),
  ('ffa2fdc7-fc4c-46db-927a-858aa6da5249', '4LMJ7', NULL, 'Hopper Undercarriage: 1,000 lb, 40 1/4 in L x 26 7/8 in W x 8 7/8 in H, Tub Undercarriage', 'These modular tub carts are color-coded to help prevent cross-contamination and consist of plastic tubs and metal undercarriages, sold individually and paired to create a wheeled cart for moving large volumes of bulk goods. The carts are sometimes known as tub dollies. The tubs and undercarriages can be swapped out for compatible styles to adapt the carts for different applications. Lids can be added to cover the top of the tubs and protect their contents from contamination or loss.', NULL, '560d9434-7180-4f89-9ff6-38a4c650eb0d', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/4LMJ7_AS01', '447915.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '4LMJ7', '{"Load Capacity": "1,000 lb", "Overall Width": "26-7/8 in", "Overall Height": "8-7/8 in", "Overall Length": "40-1/4 in", "Caster/Wheel Configuration": "(2) Axle-Mounted, (2) Swivel", "Caster Wheel/Tread Material": "Phenolic"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:35.023', '2026-06-19 11:28:35.023'),
  ('516b9369-4bf0-4cf3-bf72-ef849402353c', '6UUK2', NULL, 'Hole Seal: Steel, 30.5 mm Conduit Hole Size, For 1.25 in Hole Dia - Max, Carbon Steel, 12', 'Oiltight hole seals keep dirt, moisture, and oil from entering access holes for conduit and push buttons, and help extend the lifespan of electrical components within an enclosure.', NULL, '9f03fe37-6fc7-438d-92ad-509522613fbf', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/6UUK1_AS01', '10284.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '6UUK2', '{"Color": "Gray", "Finish": "Powder Coated", "Material": "Carbon Steel", "For Hole Type": "Push Buttons, Conduit, Knockouts", "Conduit Hole Size": "30.5 mm", "NEMA Enclosure Rating": "12", "For Hole Diameter - Maximum": "1.25 in"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:35.08', '2026-06-19 11:28:35.08'),
  ('d2c9d7e8-1cb2-4401-8289-5245e66b7973', '25GJ36', NULL, 'Manifold: 24-0266, 4GB45/4NB84/4NB85, AC1-PH65-30G/AS2-PH08-20G/AS2-SH08-30G', 'These replacement parts repair worn or damaged components in compatible air compressors.', NULL, '61b0ed00-6ff6-415b-bd3b-8de526c1089d', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/NOTAVAIL', '21023.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '25GJ36', '{"Product Type": "Manifold", "Manufacturer Part Number": "24-0266", "Compatible with Grainger Part Number": "4NB85, 4NB84, 4GB45", "Compatible with Manufacturer Part Number": "AS2-PH08-20G, AC1-PH65-30G, AS2-SH08-30G"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:35.126', '2026-06-19 11:28:35.126'),
  ('4d05e699-baf7-4832-b209-06997c0262b1', '422W59', NULL, 'Circulating Pump: 1/4 hp HP, 115/208 - 230V AC, Bronze, 1, 78 gpm, 19 ft Max. Head, Inline', 'High-flow inline circulator pumps, also known as vertical multi-stage pumps, have multiple, vertically stacked impellers that generate enough pressure to circulate water through a system in large facilities, such as high-rise buildings.', NULL, 'ba652497-40dc-458c-aca0-aea11ac624db', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/NOTAVAIL', '2285436.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '422W59', '{"Phase": "Single", "Horsepower": "1/4 hp", "System Type": "Potable Water", "Number of Speeds": "1", "Nameplate Voltage": "115/208 - 230V AC", "Flow Rate - Maximum": "78 gpm", "Pump Casing Material": "Bronze", "Feet of Head - Maximum": "19 ft"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:35.162', '2026-06-19 11:28:35.162'),
  ('82ac1897-7f1d-4817-ab8e-66a8f09ac4b3', '794FZ2', NULL, 'Hook-and-Loop Surface Conditioning Disc: 5 in Dia, Ceramic, Extra Coarse, PN-DH, 50 PK', 'Cool-cutting coating-removal discs optimized for use on all materials have an extra-coarse ceramic abrasive. Extra-coarse nonwoven coating-removal abrasives clean welds and strip rust, paint, and corrosion without modifying the shape of the workpiece. Ceramic self-sharpens faster than other abrasives to remove material quicker. Quicker material removal speeds up the work and keeps the surface cooler, making ceramic a good choice for heat-sensitive metals. Example materials include metal, composites, wood, ceramic, plastic, and porcelain.', NULL, '3dd3571a-c6dc-4ea3-83df-bcbf6d052432', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/794FZ2__WE6A_v1', '188898.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '794FZ2', '{"Grade": "Extra Coarse", "Series": "PN-DH", "Abrasive Type": "Non-Woven", "Overall Diameter": "5 in", "Abrasive Material": "Ceramic", "Vacuum Hole Pattern": "Non-Vacuum"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:35.194', '2026-06-19 11:28:35.194'),
  ('1edba74d-05e4-4f1f-b0a0-0b2dcd4aa88b', '793GA7', NULL, 'Hand Sanitizer Dispenser: Manual, CrackleClean Series, White, Plastic', 'Manual hand sanitizer dispensers operate without a power source. Users manually push a paddle or lever to dispense a prescribed amount of sanitizer per pump.', NULL, '43ebed6b-d4e5-48fe-ab6e-049443b66054', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/2158424PrimaryImage__OGCB_v2', '5828.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '793GA7', '{"Color": "White", "Finish": "Plastic", "Series": "CrackleClean", "Mount Type": "Wall", "Refill Size": "15.8 oz", "Operation Mode": "Manual", "Compatible with Manufacturer Model Number": "793GA8"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:35.22', '2026-06-19 11:28:35.22'),
  ('d511abbc-5180-44f2-8bf5-0d28475b2e7a', '400WK8', NULL, 'Liquid Line Filter Dryer: Steel, For 50 ton System, Activated Alumina, 7.2 in Lg', 'Steel shell filter driers install into refrigeration systems and remove moisture and contaminants from the refrigerant. Their steel shells can withstand higher pressures and are commonly used for larger systems over 5 tons in capacity.', NULL, 'b7b8f0f4-3f0d-4a92-8226-cb5d962f7385', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/FilterDrier__DFPV_v2', '21700.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '400WK8', '{"Finish": "Powder Painted", "Product Type": "Liquid Line Filter Dryer", "Body Material": "Steel", "Connection Size": "5/8 in", "Connection Type": "SAE Flare", "A2L Compatibility": "A2L Compatible", "For Refrigerant Type": "R-404A, R-12, R-502, R-500, R-507, R-290, R-22, R-407C, R-134A, R-410A", "For Refrigerant Group": "HCFC, HFC, HC, CFC"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:35.261', '2026-06-19 11:28:35.261'),
  ('84152957-150b-47a7-9c93-215ccdfca066', '782HA2', NULL, 'Pipe: 304 Stainless Steel, 1/4 in Nominal Pipe Size, 22 in Overall Lg, Threaded on Both Ends', 'These Schedule 80 stainless steel pipe and pipe nipples connect with medium pressure pipe fittings. Schedule 80 pipe nipples have thicker walls than Schedule 40 pipe and pipe nipples.', NULL, 'f0e0a1f9-a714-4aea-84c9-b5f100d3a0c5', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/782G86_AS01', '21503.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '782HA2', '{"Schedule": "Schedule 80", "Threading": "NPT", "Pipe Material": "304 Stainless Steel", "Overall Length": "22 in", "Pressure Level": "Medium Pressure (300-999 psi)", "Nominal Pipe Size": "1/4 in", "Thread Configuration": "Threaded on Both Ends", "Metal Pipe Construction": "Seamless"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:35.292', '2026-06-19 11:28:35.292'),
  ('8e93da32-ff15-4445-a20b-85ee299e98fa', '901N96', NULL, 'Athletic Shoe: Men''s, Size 11, EE, Blue, Composite Toe Cap, Removable Insole', 'Athletic-style safety-toe shoes are designed with lightweight, breathable materials that provide enhanced cushioning and flexibility. They have a casual aesthetic and are suitable for indoor environments. Composite toe cap material is nonmetallic and significantly lighter than steel. Flat Heel has a continuous, uninterrupted sole design with minimal variation in height from the toe to the heel. It provides comfort and grip on even flooring and pavement. Wide is a range that includes W, E, and EE shoe widths.', NULL, 'e0fbb433-113e-4598-b6c3-44ac0f55af96', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/7dc90c78-c96c-443f-be46-3ef24__YFJS_v5', '57730.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '901N96', '{"Size": "11", "Gender": "Men''s", "Color Family": "Blue", "Footwear Style": "Athletic Shoe", "Footwear Width": "EE, Wide", "Overall Height": "3 in", "Toe Cap Material": "Composite", "ASTM Standards Met": "Electrical Hazard (EH), Compression (C), Impact (I)"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:35.33', '2026-06-19 11:28:35.33'),
  ('0ff46fea-d71a-4536-8e7d-770268333397', '812KV8', NULL, 'Slotted Shim: Slotted Shim, 2 in Shim Lg, 1 1/2 in Shim Wd, 0.375 in Thick, 1 1/2 in Slot Wd, 300', 'Plastic horseshoe shims are smooth, U-shaped shims that fit around bolts and anchors to align and level components with each other. They are used to correct uneven floors and mounting surfaces and aid in window installation.', NULL, '985c2cdf-6f1c-42e4-a72f-58cd27c423e4', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/Plastichorseshoeshimsasst1__TQS8_v2', '70533.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '812KV8', '{"Material": "Plastic", "Thickness": "0.375 in", "Shim Width": "1-1/2 in", "Slot Depth": "1-1/2 in", "Slot Width": "1-1/2 in", "Shim Length": "2 in", "Slotted Shim Type": "Slotted Shim", "Material Grade/Class": "Ungraded"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:35.362', '2026-06-19 11:28:35.362'),
  ('d55bcae9-5c91-4c8f-b025-d58a3b435565', '2YDK1', NULL, 'Quick Connection Coupling: Straight, 1/8 in Pipe Size, NPT x MNPT, Acetal, White, 1 in Overall Lg', 'Acetal quick-disconnect tube fittings are suitable for air and potable water applications, including commercial and residential irrigation systems. These fittings are made from acetal plastic, also called polyacetal and polyoxymethylene (POM), a general purpose thermoplastic that resists corrosive and sensitive media, plus withstands changes in temperature and humidity.', NULL, 'eb187298-f5e1-40b6-a1d4-b0472cdc63d0', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/2YDK1-A3020-1_v2', '11882.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '2YDK1', '{"Series": "PMC12", "Pipe Size": "1/8 in", "Thread Type": "NPT", "Fitting Shape": "Straight", "Connector Type": "Coupling", "Fitting Material": "Acetal", "Flow Control Type": "Shut-off", "End Connection Type": "Threaded"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:35.4', '2026-06-19 11:28:35.4'),
  ('5d4378c6-bb95-40b8-bbeb-ac0d8af44e59', '823C87', NULL, 'Motorized Wand Cellular Shade: Blackout, 36 in Ht, 63 1/2 in Wd, 3/8 mm Thick, Tan', 'Motorized wand blackout cellular shades raise and lower with the attached controller, completely block incoming light, and are suitable for bedrooms and patient rooms to improve sleep quality.', NULL, '839aab3b-2502-428a-b15d-2e595ac1712d', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/TanMotorizedCellularBlackoutW__YITX_v2', '191168.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '823C87', '{"Shade Width": "63-1/2 in", "Shade Height": "36 in", "Fabric Weight": "35 g", "Shade Material": "Polyester", "Shade Thickness": "3/8 mm", "Shade Color Family": "Tan", "Operation Mechanism": "Motorized Wand", "Light Reduction - Qualitiative": "Blackout"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:35.433', '2026-06-19 11:28:35.433'),
  ('e8c58db4-1028-4b0a-9f17-d461344ff74b', '457T55', NULL, 'Rotary Shaft Seal: 1 Lip w/Spring, SA, Nitrile, 57 mm ID, 80 mm OD, 12 mm Wd, 7 psi Max Pressure', 'These single-lip rotary shaft seals retain oil and have a reinforced metal case for a strong, rigid fitting to a bore with a smooth finish. Their sealing lip presses against the shaft to prevent oil from leaking out during operation. Single-lip seals can operate at higher speeds than dual-lip seals.', NULL, 'aef83687-8ecf-46e9-a7e1-3678ac8ba7c3', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/52WD03_AW01', '12258.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '457T55', '{"Seal Design": "SA", "Lip Material": "Nitrile Rubber", "Overall Width": "12 mm", "Number of Lips": "1", "Inside Diameter": "57 mm", "Maximum Pressure": "7 psi", "Outside Diameter": "80 mm", "System of Measurement": "Metric"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:35.467', '2026-06-19 11:28:35.467'),
  ('e299ea67-21e9-4fee-8eab-ba5130d35bed', '1F523', NULL, 'Jobber Length Drill Bit: 21/64", 118° Point, Black Oxide HSS', 'These general purpose high-speed steel jobber-length drill bits for metal and plastic have regular spiral flutes that are best suited for nonchipping hard materials such as nonferrous metals, cast iron, and structural steel.', NULL, '8a4d0ae9-f1e5-40af-8923-811f70babcf2', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/F_CL_150__NA1I_v1', '3821.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '1F523', '{"Point Type": "Conventional", "Flute Length": "3-5/16 in", "Drill Bit Size": "21/64 in", "Finish/Coating": "Black Oxide", "Overall Length": "4-5/8 in", "Measurement System": "Fractional Inch", "Drill Bit Point Angle": "118  Degrees", "Size Decimal Equivalent": "0.3281"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:35.502', '2026-06-19 11:28:35.502'),
  ('e99730e9-687a-4091-bc60-717238be2113', '856KE8', NULL, 'Machine Screw: #5-40 Thread Size, 1/4 in Lg, 18-8, Stainless Steel, Passivated, Round, 100 PK', 'Round head machine screws have a slightly domed top for easy-access fastening to metal parts. They offer an attractive smooth finish and come in slotted or Phillips drive types.', NULL, 'f0e0a1f9-a714-4aea-84c9-b5f100d3a0c5', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/2BB35_GC01__CFDN_v1', '2486.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '856KE8', '{"Type": "Machine Screw", "Head Type": "Round", "Finish Type": "Passivated", "Thread Size": "#5-40", "Material Grade": "18-8", "Fastener Length": "1/4 in", "U-Bolt Material": "Stainless Steel", "System of Measurement": "Inch"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:35.541', '2026-06-19 11:28:35.541'),
  ('98742c40-29e3-4a38-92bf-f1a283bf5267', '9LJ64', NULL, 'Standard Stainless Steel Cloth Test Sieve: Stainless Steel, 8 in Outside Dia, 2 5/8 in Ht', 'Standard stainless steel-cloth test sieves resist deformation when used with noncombustible and abrasive materials, including ceramic and diamond grit. Stainless steel is also safe for use in food processing and sieving very fine substances.', NULL, 'ab1b2da6-b4a5-4b92-b811-db619967e5e9', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/BS8Ffine__BGSU_v2', '39875.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '9LJ64', '{"Mesh Size": "Medium", "Opening Size": "1.7 mm", "Product Type": "Standard Stainless Steel Cloth Test Sieve", "Frame Material": "Brass", "Overall Height": "2-5/8 in", "Screen Material": "Stainless Steel", "Outside Diameter": "8 in", "US Standard Screen Size": "#12"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:35.589', '2026-06-19 11:28:35.589'),
