  ('f2e5237e-964f-44f8-aa93-bd73d5589007', '8TLK5', NULL, 'Refractometer: +/-1° F, Auto, Analog, 0.01 RI/5°F, 32°F Auto Temp Compensation - Max', 'Analog handheld refractometers have a built-in magnifying glass for manually reading refraction on an integrated scale. Handheld meters are more portable than benchtop meters, so they can be taken to a test site and carried around a facility. They are also waterproof and durable for carrying in the field.', NULL, 'b7553a3d-d86c-4672-ad66-dcbb296f332d', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/8TLK5-3__R4LV_v2', '156957.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '8TLK5', '{"Accuracy": "+/-1 Degrees  F", "Resolution": "0.01 RI, 5 Degrees F", "Display Type": "Analog", "Product Type": "Refractometer", "Test Parameters": "Propylene Glycol, Refractive Index, Ethylene Glycol, Propylene Glycol Freeze Point, Ethylene Glycol Freeze Point"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:40.008', '2026-06-19 11:28:40.008'),
  ('3b99294b-38cb-45d6-b7a1-774937b1b806', '26LW98', NULL, 'Sanding Belt: 2 in W x 60 in L, Aluminum Oxide, 50 Grit, X Wt Cotton Backing, 10 PK', 'General purpose sanding belts for carbon steel and soft metals have a closed-coat aluminum oxide abrasive. Other workpiece material examples include structural steel, cast iron, and heat-sensitive alloys. Aluminum oxide is a strong, sharp, and durable abrasive that penetrates the work surface and withstands heat and high speeds. Closed-coat abrasives have abrasive grain across the entire surface to provide a smoother finish and faster material removal than open-coat coverage.', NULL, '627d2578-72c3-4ab7-8e10-81c3993f0498', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/26LW98_AS01', '60362.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '26LW98', '{"Belt Backing": "X Wt Cloth", "Abrasive Grit": "50 / P50", "Overall Width": "2 in", "Abrasive Grade": "Coarse", "Overall Length": "60 in", "Belt Dimensions": "2x60", "Coating Coverage": "Closed", "Abrasive Material": "Aluminum Oxide"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:40.066', '2026-06-19 11:28:40.066'),
  ('903e7103-6394-4727-8b75-54534dd3d549', '9RUP5', NULL, 'Filter: Postfilter/Prefilter, 4 3/8 in Overall Ht, 24 3/4 in Overall Wd, 2', 'Fume hood filters trap and remove harmful vapors, gasses, and particulates to improve overall air quality. Filters are replaced as a regular part of the maintenance process and are compatible with hoods of the same brand and series.', NULL, 'ed7602ec-6247-4acc-8fcf-eeefad36cb38', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/9RUP5_AS01', '35964.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '9RUP5', '{"Filter Type": "Postfilter, Prefilter", "For Use With": "Paramount Duet Filtered Enclosures (Pre-9/2008), Paramount Filtered Enclosures (Pre-9/2008)", "Product Type": "Filter", "Nominal Depth": "16 in", "Nominal Width": "6 ft", "Overall Width": "24-3/4 in", "Overall Height": "4-3/8 in", "Filter Efficiency": "Varies by Chemical"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:40.098', '2026-06-19 11:28:40.098'),
  ('a686d607-6504-46df-b84f-977e56ec5e6e', '56PX94', NULL, 'Indexable Cutting Unit Head for External Turning: Right Hand, 128.00mm Overall Lg', 'WALTER, Right Hand, Indexable Cutting Unit Head for External Turning', NULL, '87e47d62-5001-428a-8adf-5939a553847b', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/56PL57_AS01', '254416.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '56PX94', '{"Overall Length": "128.00mm", "Cutting Direction": "Right Hand"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:40.138', '2026-06-19 11:28:40.138'),
  ('22af44fa-f1d4-497e-ab32-6724785671dc', '866N01', NULL, 'Building Wire: Copper, 3 AWG, 1 Conductors, Stranded, Red, 1,000 ft Lg, THHN/THWN-2', 'Copper THHN/THWN-2 building wires are insulated general-use cables for lighting and other low-voltage applications. They are more flexible than other cable types, allowing them to fit into tighter spaces and be used for moving parts or equipment. They have a durable nylon sheath within their PVC insulation that helps protect them against moisture, abrasion, and chemical exposure. While they are rated to handle some moisture, they are less moisture-resistant than XHHW-2 cable. They are rated to handle 600V and can be used in dry locations up to 194°F or wet locations up to 167°F. Copper conductors are flexible "hot" wires carrying power distribution systems'' current. They are heavier than aluminum wires but can handle higher current loads for the same size of wire. Stranded core cables consist of multiple individual wires twisted together and encased by an external layer of insulation. Spool packaging is a cylinder with cabling wrapped tightly around it to minimize the space it takes up. The spool can be placed in a stand or mount, allowing it to spin freely and dispense large cable lengths quickly. They are typically smaller than reels and made from lighter materials to make handling and transport easier.', NULL, '7044f7e0-af0d-4f9a-9d47-224f7bc4625a', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/20490906_PrimaryImage__OALP_v1', '1133433.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '866N01', '{"Voltage": "600 V", "Conductor Size": "3 AWG", "Overall Length": "1,000 ft", "Conductor Design": "Stranded", "Trade Designation": "THHN, THWN-2", "Conductor Material": "Copper", "Number of Conductors": "1", "Conductor Insulation Color": "Red"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:40.171', '2026-06-19 11:28:40.171'),
  ('8aa2ce92-4909-4635-9f85-d0b77a8a412f', '60JT66', NULL, 'Take-Up Bearing: 19351112, Tapered Roller, Steel Insert, 1 3/4 in Bore', 'These take-up unit bearings have tapered rollers which can support heavy radial, axial, or thrust loads. They withstand more axial movement than radial ball bearings in conveyor applications.', NULL, '0cc64027-6405-4de9-a1de-01cf23db55f8', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/60JR61_AS01', '288768.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '60JT66', '{"Bore Diameter": "1-3/4 in", "Overall Width": "3.5 in", "Overall Height": "4.75 in", "Overall Length": "6.312 in", "Bearing Insert Type": "Tapered Roller", "System of Measurement": "Inch"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:40.212', '2026-06-19 11:28:40.212'),
  ('8457c291-9728-40be-a0a9-f136e85741b6', '60JA58', NULL, 'Coated Gloves: XL ( 10 ), ANSI Cut Level A4, Palm, Dipped, Polyurethane, Smooth, 12 PK', 'Medium cut-level knit gloves with polyurethane coating provide a good grip when handling dry workpieces. Medium cut levels (ANSI A4-A5) protect against cuts caused when performing automotive assembly and mining tasks, encountering sharp edges on ductwork, and handling recycling materials. Polyurethane is lightweight and breathable to keep hands cool. It is less resistant to oil and abrasion than other coatings.', NULL, '82b0aa22-f91a-4467-83e4-909598f25e4e', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/60JA56-A0090-1_v1', '74345.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '60JA58', '{"Coating Type": "Dipped", "Knit Material": "HyperMax(TM)", "ANSI/ISEA Cut Level": "A4", "Glove Coating Cover": "Palm", "Glove Coating Finish": "Smooth", "Palm Coating Material": "Polyurethane", "ANSI/ISEA Abrasion Level": "4", "Additional Hazard Protection": "None"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:40.246', '2026-06-19 11:28:40.246'),
  ('259567a4-336e-4484-9228-4b9f3b9ef966', '44AH79', NULL, 'Ball Pein Hammer Handle, 24-28 oz.: For 28 oz Max Head Wt, For 1 1/16 in Eye Opening Lg', 'Hammer handles replace broken or loose handles and allow switching to different handle materials or lengths to suit an application. These handles fit hammer heads of a specific brand, eye shape, and eye size.', NULL, 'bc3094b9-fc98-4a95-9bc1-39c3940e0e72', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/44AH63_AW01', '8845.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '44AH79', '{"For Eye Shape": "Oval", "Overall Length": "16 in", "Handle Material": "Wood", "For Eye Opening Width": "5/8 in", "For Eye Opening Length": "1-1/16 in", "For Maximum Hammer Head Weight": "Less than 2 lbs"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:40.286', '2026-06-19 11:28:40.286'),
  ('897237c4-134c-409e-979a-29ce4f723be4', '61AZ33', NULL, 'Rotary Shaft Seal: 2 Lip w/Spring, TC, Nitrile, 42 mm ID, 60 mm OD, 12 mm Wd, 7 psi Max Pressure', 'These dual-lip rotary shaft seals retain oil and have a rubber-enclosed metal case for fitting to a bore housing with a rough surface. The rubber conforms to the rough bore to ensure a tight fit. These seals have an auxiliary lip, or dust lip, that protects the sealing lip from contaminants in harsher environments. Dual-lip seals reduce wear and extend the life of the seal but operate at lower speeds than single-lip seals.', NULL, 'aef83687-8ecf-46e9-a7e1-3678ac8ba7c3', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/60YW33_AW01', '8667.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '61AZ33', '{"Seal Design": "TC", "Lip Material": "Nitrile Rubber", "Overall Width": "12 mm", "Number of Lips": "2", "Inside Diameter": "42 mm", "Maximum Pressure": "7 psi", "Outside Diameter": "60 mm", "System of Measurement": "Metric"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:40.32', '2026-06-19 11:28:40.32'),
  ('a80adff0-d25f-43bc-88a9-abe9ad0cc451', '429W34', NULL, 'Individual Stencil: Pedestrian, 0.125 in Thick, 30 in Overall Ht, 107 in Overall Wd, Highway Gothic', 'Heavy-duty message stencils for traffic and parking control create markings on roads, parking lots, and other areas with vehicle traffic. They are thicker and more durable than light-duty stencils, making them ideal for frequent or heavy use.', NULL, '0a46e20d-d67f-48aa-bcc8-882c7a416bc2', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/429W34_AS01', '153150.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '429W34', '{"Material": "Polyethylene", "Overall Stencil Width": "107 in", "Overall Stencil Height": "30 in", "Included Characters, Messages, and Symbols": "Pedestrian"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:40.362', '2026-06-19 11:28:40.362'),
  ('409f3909-dc34-4c40-9ef3-f52afb2f0fcb', '33N407', NULL, 'Flap Disc: Radial, 4-1/2" x 7/8", Ceramic, 60 Grit, Fiberglass Bk, High Density, CO SGP CURVE', 'Cool-cutting flap discs for carbon and stainless steel are self-sharpening to remove material faster than other abrasives. Faster removal also keeps the surface cooler, making ceramic a good choice for heat-sensitive metals. Other workpiece material examples include structural steel, cast iron, and heat-sensitive alloys.', NULL, '6dd3262c-bc89-42b5-a54c-858c0c04f6ba', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/33N407_AS01', '13146.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '33N407', '{"Abrasive Grade": "Coarse", "Density Rating": "High", "Flap Disc Type": "Radial", "Arbor Hole Size": "7/8 in", "Arbor Hole Type": "Unthreaded", "Overall Diameter": "4-1/2 in", "Abrasive Material": "Ceramic", "Backing Plate Material": "Fiberglass"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:40.403', '2026-06-19 11:28:40.403'),
  ('09c0184c-8551-4636-9113-17ed4d529dad', '23YL66', NULL, 'Calibration Gas: Air, Disposable, +/-5% Accuracy, H2, Calibration Gas, 17 L Cylinder Capacity', 'Portable gas detector calibration gases are precise, known mixtures of specified gases contained in a pressurized cylinder. They work with compatible testing equipment to confirm or adjust a detector''s alert parameters.', NULL, '74fc0d1d-0e05-43f8-abe4-362ba10c6784', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/23YJ92_AS01', '29822.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '23YL66', '{"Gas Type": "Hydrogen", "Background Gas": "Air", "Cylinder Capacity": "17 L", "Calibration Product Type": "Calibration Gas"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:40.441', '2026-06-19 11:28:40.441'),
  ('1d348f09-a869-4056-bba4-3e562b26fea4', '11R773', NULL, 'Headed Press-Fit Drill Bushing (H): Std Wall, 5.25 mm Inside Dia., 13/32 in Outside Dia.', 'Metric headed (H) press-fit drill bushings come in standard sizes expressed in millimeters. Standard-wall headed press-fit drill bushings have thicker walls and are typically sturdier than thin-wall headed press-fit bushings.', NULL, 'f0e0a1f9-a714-4aea-84c9-b5f100d3a0c5', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/11N935_AS01', '5485.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '11R773', '{"Drill Size": "5.25 mm", "Inside Dia.": "5.25 mm", "Bushing Code": "HM", "Outside Dia.": "13/32 in", "Bushing Head Type": "Headed", "Decimal Equivalent": "0.2067", "Measurement System": "Metric", "Drill Bushing Wall Type": "Standard Wall"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:40.477', '2026-06-19 11:28:40.477'),
  ('cb8fab65-2cf3-4a42-b400-2d8f42a02d73', '820X16', NULL, 'Flame-Resistant Shirt: 10.6 cal/sq cm ATPV, Men''s, Tall, 2XL, Aramid ( 6.5 oz ), Long, Navy', 'Category 2 garments meet NFPA 70E standards and have a minimum arc flash rating of 8 cal/cm2. Henleys are collarless shirts that have buttons at the neckline that allow workers to adjust shirt opening at the collar.', NULL, '89e0ce8b-bf79-4943-902d-7896b818d8ce', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/385-FRHN-NV---MF__Z9TI_v2', '41445.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '820X16', '{"Size": "2XL", "Gender": "Men''s", "Fabric Wt": "Mediumweight", "ATPV Rating": "10.6 cal/sq cm", "Shirt Style": "Henley", "Size - Body Type": "Tall", "Material Trade Name": "Aramid", "Arc Flash PPE Category": "2"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:40.512', '2026-06-19 11:28:40.512'),
  ('d83c935f-e9a3-4aef-86e3-bc813fec7e72', '36NG24', NULL, 'Angular Contact Ball Bearing: 3312/5312, 2 Rows, 30°, Open, ABEC 1, Steel Cage, 60 mm Bore', 'Double-row angular contact bearings act as a matching set of singular bearings arranged back-to-back, or a duplex, while saving space on the shaft. They accommodate axial loads in both directions.', NULL, '3819a5d3-6267-48eb-b0b1-62f5b0f6b4d2', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/36NE87_AS01', '360166.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '36NG24', '{"Closure": "Open", "ABEC Rating": "1", "Bearing Type": "Single Bearing", "Bore Diameter": "60 mm", "Contact Angle": "30  Degrees", "Number of Rows": "Two", "Outside Diameter": "130 mm", "Bearing Industry Number": "3312/5312"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:40.541', '2026-06-19 11:28:40.541'),
  ('1ab96e44-2780-4339-99d0-8a30f16571e0', '804DR3', NULL, '360 Brass Rectangular Bar: 360, 1 in x 36 in Nominal Size (WxL), 0.5 in Thick, Mill', 'Grade 360 brass flat bars contain lead to make them easy to cut, shape, grind, and polish with machine tools. These flat bars are strong, resist rust and corrosion, and maintain their shape in many industrial applications. They are often manufactured into plumbing parts and components, fittings, shafts, valves, electronic parts and components, couplings, machine parts, and hardware. Grade 360 is also known as free-machining brass.', NULL, 'f0e0a1f9-a714-4aea-84c9-b5f100d3a0c5', 'https://static.grainger.com/rp/s/is/image/Grainger/rectangle-bar-large-new-min-4__DDN8_v2', '43734.00', NULL, 'in_stock', NULL, 'f', '804DR3', '{"Temper": "H02", "Thickness": "0.5 in", "Overall Width": "1 in", "Material Grade": "360", "Overall Length": "36 in", "Yield Strength": "44,000 psi", "Mechanical Finish": "Mill", "Rockwell Hardness": "B78"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 11:28:40.572', '2026-06-19 11:28:40.572'),
